# cards: a worn card from the Special list (docs/plan-cards.md 2.4). Jian and Lucia (party2_strong), first temple
# battle. Lucia wears the Quetzalcoatl card (her slot 5, 0x020B46FE = 236) with 2000 points (0x020B48AC). Round 1:
# Jian Fights; Lucia's Special list shows Healing Water and the card entry (shots cu_list, cu_pick); A uses it:
# every enemy's ATK goes down (banners, shots cu_use_*), the card's points drop to 1900, her battle MP (record 1,
# 0x0228E8E4) stays 18. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
poke u16 0x020B48AC 2000
poke u16 0x020B46FE 236
wait 270
watch u32 0x0228E8E4 lucia_mp
watch u16 0x020B48AC points
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot cu_list
press Down 8
wait 30
shot cu_pick
press A 8
wait 10
